{"sectionId":"metabolism/lipid","items":[{"id":"metabolism--lipid-k001","sectionId":"metabolism/lipid","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"장쇄 지방산은 acyl-CoA로 활성화된 후 카르니틴 셔틀을 통해 미토콘드리아 기질로 들어간다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--lipid-k002","sectionId":"metabolism/lipid","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"β산화는 산화(FAD), 수화, 산화(NAD⁺), thiolysis의 반복으로 acetyl-CoA를 두 탄소씩 떼어낸다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--lipid-k003","sectionId":"metabolism/lipid","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"Palmitoyl-CoA(C16)는 7회 β산화로 8 acetyl-CoA, 7 NADH, 7 FAD 환원당량을 만든다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--lipid-k004","sectionId":"metabolism/lipid","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"유리 팔미트산 활성화 비용은 ATP 등가 2개다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--lipid-k005","sectionId":"metabolism/lipid","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"지방산 합성은 주로 세포질에서 acetyl-CoA carboxylase가 malonyl-CoA를 생성하고 fatty acid synthase가 NADPH를 사용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--lipid-k006","sectionId":"metabolism/lipid","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"Malonyl-CoA는 CPT1을 억제한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--lipid-k007","sectionId":"metabolism/lipid","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"공복·저인슐린 상태에서 간은 지방산 유래 acetyl-CoA로 ketone body(아세토아세트산, β-hydroxybutyrate, acetone)를 만든다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--lipid-k008","sectionId":"metabolism/lipid","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"간은 SCOT가 부족해 케톤체를 주요 연료로 직접 이용하지 못한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--lipid-k009","sectionId":"metabolism/lipid","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"장기간 금식에서 뇌의 케톤체 이용이 증가한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--lipid-k010","sectionId":"metabolism/lipid","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"아미노산의 질소는 아미노기 전이·탈아미노화로 처리되며 간 요소회로는 독성 암모니아를 요소로 바꾼다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--lipid-k011","sectionId":"metabolism/lipid","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"요소의 두 질소는 암모니아와 aspartate에서 온다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--lipid-k012","sectionId":"metabolism/lipid","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"β산화는 주로 미토콘드리아, 지방산 합성은 세포질.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--lipid-k013","sectionId":"metabolism/lipid","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"CPT1 억제: malonyl-CoA.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--lipid-k014","sectionId":"metabolism/lipid","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"요소회로는 미토콘드리아와 세포질에 걸쳐 있으며 CPS1은 N-acetylglutamate로 활성화된다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--lipid-k015","sectionId":"metabolism/lipid","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"8개다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}